        {
          "id": 3160649135,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Then what I should do instead?\n\nI looked this file and has many `DISSECTOR_ASSERT` so I did not think it was wrong.\n\nThen I looked other dissectors for `hkdf_extract()` and \n- `packet-ieee802154.c` (`trel_key_derivation_func()`) has the same coding as I provided in this MR\n- `packet-wireguard.c` (`wg_kdf()`) has the same coding as I provided in this MR\n\nBased on those above, I thought I did the right thing to fix this Coverity warning.",
